      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Battlegrounds are team-based PvP content. Tierra Gorge, Flavius and KVM run in turn, and you can earn various badges and Battleground Points."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "path": "battleground.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "How It Works",
      "anchor": "cycle"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The Battlegrounds repeat in the cycle below."
    },
