    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Using Battleground Points",
      "text": "Exchange Battleground Points for various costume items with the exchange helper NPC in the middle of the Battleground zone. More items will be added over time."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Short-Handed Match System",
      "anchor": "relax"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "To reduce Battlegrounds that cannot start because of too few players, the NEED server has its own Short-Handed Match System."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "The party leader applies for the Battleground.",
        "You can apply even when you are one player short of the minimum.",
        "The Battleground starts when the other team's party leader accepts.",
        "Example: 10 vs 9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "NEED-Only System",
      "text": "The Short-Handed Match System is a NEED server feature that keeps Battlegrounds running smoothly."
    },
